# Presence and status

Read `docs/PRESENCE_AND_STATUS.md` and `docs/POWER_BUDGET.md`.

- Workspace reporting is owned by `packages/web/src/entities/user/user-workspace-presence-reporter.lib.ts`; preserve activity/visibility-dependent timing and owner cancellation.
- Presence, user-selected status, and account deactivation are distinct inputs. Do not synthesize online state from an unrelated field.
- Shared Avatar/PresenceIndicator own visual geometry. WorkspaceAvatar adapts Workspace user data; do not duplicate status-dot placement in consumers.
- Use the current Workspace presence API and UUID identity. Legacy helpers or fixed timer examples are not the reporting contract.
- Cover transitions between active/background/idle and account/runtime changes when changing the reporter; report visual/native QA gaps separately.
